{"fps": 30, "frames": 1611, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 143, "text": "For fourteen years, Wall Street's best stock pickers battled a dartboard.", "words": [{"w": "For", "f": 0, "e": 6}, {"w": "fourteen", "f": 7, "e": 21}, {"w": "years,", "f": 23, "e": 37}, {"w": "Wall", "f": 43, "e": 49}, {"w": "Street's", "f": 50, "e": 64}, {"w": "best", "f": 67, "e": 71}, {"w": "stock", "f": 73, "e": 80}, {"w": "pickers", "f": 82, "e": 94}, {"w": "battled", "f": 96, "e": 105}, {"w": "a", "f": 107, "e": 110}, {"w": "dartboard.", "f": 114, "e": 144}]}, {"a": 143, "b": 265, "text": "An old book joked a blindfolded monkey could match the experts.", "words": [{"w": "An", "f": 145, "e": 146}, {"w": "old", "f": 149, "e": 153}, {"w": "book", "f": 157, "e": 160}, {"w": "joked", "f": 162, "e": 169}, {"w": "a", "f": 178, "e": 183}, {"w": "blindfolded", "f": 189, "e": 203}, {"w": "monkey", "f": 206, "e": 217}, {"w": "could", "f": 219, "e": 222}, {"w": "match", "f": 224, "e": 231}, {"w": "the", "f": 232, "e": 233}, {"w": "experts.", "f": 235, "e": 258}]}, {"a": 265, "b": 373, "text": "So in nineteen eighty-eight, the Wall Street Journal tried it.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 267, "e": 274}, {"w": "in", "f": 279, "e": 281}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 283, "e": 293}, {"w": "eighty-eight,", "f": 295, "e": 313}, {"w": "the", "f": 315, "e": 317}, {"w": "Wall", "f": 318, "e": 322}, {"w": "Street", "f": 325, "e": 331}, {"w": "Journal", "f": 334, "e": 343}, {"w": "tried", "f": 345, "e": 352}, {"w": "it.", "f": 354, "e": 373}]}, {"a": 373, "b": 519, "text": "No monkey. Just staffers, throwing darts at stock tables on the wall.", "words": [{"w": "No", "f": 375, "e": 379}, {"w": "monkey.", "f": 382, "e": 405}, {"w": "Just", "f": 407, "e": 411}, {"w": "staffers,", "f": 416, "e": 434}, {"w": "throwing", "f": 438, "e": 446}, {"w": "darts", "f": 449, "e": 455}, {"w": "at", "f": 457, "e": 459}, {"w": "stock", "f": 464, "e": 469}, {"w": "tables", "f": 474, "e": 480}, {"w": "on", "f": 481, "e": 482}, {"w": "the", "f": 